# listings_vec.db is INTENTIONALLY committed, not ignored -- same precedent
# as schools.db (pre-built, read-only at runtime, safe to redeploy). It used
# to be gitignored as "regenerable + large binary," but that meant every
# fresh deploy (Cloud Run included) built from git had no vector index at
# all, breaking Vector search / Agent search with a real 502 the moment
# anyone hit them. Re-run `python scripts/build_listing_embeddings.py
# --data-source <realistic|generated>` and commit the result after editing
# either dataset.